# Registered HERE and not as a @Component, because both of H2Exposure's jobs happen before the
# application context exists: h2.bindAddress has to be set before org.h2.engine.SysProperties
# initialises (it reads the property into a static final), and a refusal has to land before
# spring.sql.init has opened the database file. An EnvironmentPostProcessor is the only hook early
# enough, and spring.factories is still how Boot 3 discovers them — this key was NOT migrated to the
# META-INF/spring/*.imports files, which cover auto-configuration only.
org.springframework.boot.env.EnvironmentPostProcessor=\
tech.mikhailov.fsm.orch.H2Exposure
